OL,3,GNEWSA'I put the mask on every day after
OL,4,AMegan's murder'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Elaine Newborough, the past five
OL,7,Fyears have meant learning how to get up
OL,8,Feach morning and "put the mask on and
OL,9,Fjust carry on" to cover up missing her
OL,10,Fdaughter every second.
OL,12,FMegan Newborough, 23, of Nuneaton,
OL,13,FWarwickshire, was killed by her
OL,14,Fboyfriend, Ross McCullam, 30, who was
OL,15,Fsentenced to a minimum term of 23 years
OL,16,Fin prison in 2022.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
