OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I put the mask on every day after
OL,4,AMegan's murder'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince her death, her parents have been
OL,7,Fworking with the Killed Women group to
OL,8,Fcampaign against a 10-year disparity in
OL,9,Fsentencing starting points for murders
OL,10,Fcommitted with weapons in the home and
OL,11,Fon the street.
OL,13,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ)
OL,14,Fpreviously said it intended to close
OL,15,Fthe gap, with the first part of a
OL,16,Freview of the law of homicide set to
OL,17,Fconclude.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
